Package: scReportLite
Type: Package
Title: Single-Cell Interactive HTML Report Generator
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Kee-gong",
                  family = "Park",
                  email = "karioslion0517@gmail.com",
                  role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
                  comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0000-6485-5399"))
Description: Generate portable interactive HTML report bundles from single-cell
    RNA-seq analysis results without performing biological analysis. Reads
    existing Seurat results or prepared tables and produces an HTML entry file
    plus its dependency folder with cell-level exploration, quality-control,
    feature, principal-component, embedding, and marker-result views.
